            ]),
            'id': 'p7_b011',
            'order': 11,
            'text': '''
              Table 3: Training Configurations and Cost Breakdown. This table presents the training configura-
              tions across different stages and the total cost for a single full training run, assuming the rental price
              of H200 is $2 per GPU hour.
            ''',
            'type': 'text',
          }),
          dict({
            'bbox': list([
              108.0,
